Every export carries Content Credentials

00:13:03.225 --> 00:13:06.269
by default, signed on-device.

00:13:07.038 --> 00:13:10.519
To sign as you - so a recipient who pins

00:13:10.581 --> 00:13:13.388
your root reads Verified with your address

00:13:13.478 --> 00:13:16.202
on it rather than an anonymous signer -

00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:19.095
point it at your own key and certificate

