setup path from a clean machine to a

00:13:31.145 --> 00:13:34.059
working, trusted signing identity is

00:13:34.134 --> 00:13:36.769
docs/cli-signing-md.

00:13:37.897 --> 00:13:39.228
Development

00:13:40.138 --> 00:13:42.444
New contributor?

00:13:43.222 --> 00:13:45.971
Start at CONTRIBUTING-md - it routes you

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:48.401
through the recursive clone, content

00:13:48.461 --> 00:13:53.065
profiles, the tools//catalog/ symlink-view

00:13:53.126 --> 00:13:56.127
trap, which repo owns which file and the

00:13:56.187 --> 00:13:59.245
commands to run before a PR.

00:14:00.013 --> 00:14:03.222
Auditors and anyone touching a parser or a

00:14:03.284 --> 00:14:05.194
crypto module should read

00:14:05.265 --> 00:14:07.688
docs/threat-model-md and

00:14:07.749 --> 00:14:10.594
docs/parser-inventory-md.

00:14:10.975 --> 00:14:18.150
Lolly is an umbrella repo composed of git submodules «see Repository layout».

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:24.550
That changes two things: how you clone, and where each change is committed.

00:14:25.297 --> 00:14:27.617
Clone / update

00:14:28.597 --> 00:14:31.418
Code example omitted.

00:14:32.176 --> 00:14:34.799
Each submodule is checked out on its own

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.151
main, tracking its repo under

00:14:37.214 --> 00:14:40.819
github-com/lolly-tools/*.

00:14:41.592 --> 00:14:44.660
Where your changes go - the umbrella pins

00:14:44.756 --> 00:14:48.161
a specific commit of each submodule, so a

00:14:48.223 --> 00:14:51.100
change is committed to the repo that owns

00:14:51.159 --> 00:14:54.116
the file, then the umbrella records the

00:14:54.176 --> 00:14:55.645
new pointer.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.898
The full path-to-repo ownership table

00:14:58.968 --> 00:15:02.562
lives in CONTRIBUTING-md section 4, which

00:15:02.629 --> 00:15:05.994
is the single source of truth for it.

00:15:06.375 --> 00:15:16.100
⚠️ Committing from the umbrella root does not capture edits made inside a submodule - git only sees the pointer.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:21.450
Commit inside the submodule, or use loldev «below».

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:33.000
The tools/ and catalog/ views are symlinks into the packs, so editing through them flows to the right pack checkout automatically.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:48.350
Editing a SUSE tool touches two repos «suse-lolly + umbrella pointer»; a community tool touches three «lolly-tools manifest, suse-lolly regenerated index, umbrella pointer».

00:15:49.115 --> 00:15:52.919
loldev - one command to ship a change.

00:15:53.688 --> 00:15:56.549
A helper that does the multi-repo dance

00:15:56.649 --> 00:15:57.994
for you.

00:15:58.789 --> 00:16:01.718
Install it on your PATH:

00:16:02.497 --> 00:16:05.318
Code example omitted.

00:16:06.097 --> 00:16:08.918
Code example omitted.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:17.025
loldev operates on ~/Build/lolly by default «override with LOLLY_ROOT».

00:16:17.375 --> 00:16:30.875
The underlying scripts live in scripts/subrepo/ - sync-sh, status-sh, verify-sh, plus migrate-sh/snap-history-sh «the one-time split».

00:16:31.973 --> 00:16:33.501
Current tools

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:44.600
The SUSE catalog ships 66 tools today - 65 listed in the gallery, plus one unlisted helper «Asset Export».

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:53.300
Generated from catalog/tools/index-json by npm run build:readme-tools:

00:16:54.044 --> 00:16:57.316
The utility "Offline Utilities" section

00:16:57.418 --> 00:17:00.469
always renders last in the gallery.

00:17:01.628 --> 00:17:04.042
Licensing & structure

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:16.325
Every unit now lives in its own repo under github-com/lolly-tools, pinned as a submodule of this umbrella «see Repository layout».

00:17:17.055 --> 00:17:21.575
Code - engine/, shells/, services/, docs/

00:17:21.608 --> 00:17:24.419
- is MPL-2 point 0.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.750
Tool content ships as brand packs.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:47.050
community/ «public lolly-tools» holds the brand-agnostic tools; brands/suse/ «private suse-lolly» holds the SUSE tools and catalog - including its licensed PremiumBeat music, which stays private with the pack.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:58.150
The repo-root tools/ and catalog/ are gitignored profile views assembled from those packs; see each pack's NOTICE-md.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:16.275
Fonts ship inside each brand pack under the SIL Open Font License 1 point 1 - the SUSE pack carries the SUSE and SUSE Mono typefaces «neither the MPL nor SUSE-proprietary; "SUSE" is a SUSE trademark».

00:18:16.625 --> 00:18:22.450
They appear at catalog/fonts/ in a built profile view.

00:18:23.192 --> 00:18:25.888
Bundled third-party attributions are

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.344
listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-md.
